{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_svrash_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_svrash_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"難猜的人","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_svrash_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"2712dcc45f8e4eb4305b7a8915ccf43b8e5d0a99d9f24c18ad2ae4d153423e0b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"银灰个人剧情1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，那家喀蘭貿易新成立的分公司的員工，並沒有收到我們提供給他們的第一批鎮痛劑是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這是我們的人在附近的黑市裡偶然發現的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......我們生產的鎮痛劑，確認過編號嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我特意找後勤部確認過，就是我們提供的那一批，基本上不用懷疑，就是有人把我們的藥轉手給賣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"本來這種情況其實是不用請你和博士來的，這麼幹的公司不算少見，我們已經有一套比較成熟的應對方案了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，這次這家公司是喀蘭貿易的分公司，所以我覺得還是要問一問你們兩位的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道......崖心現在是我們的幹員，而且喀蘭貿易的訂貨量不小，無論從哪個角度來說，這件事都要小心應對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"問題的核心在於這是對方中層的獨斷行為，還是被他們的領導者默許的行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Medic，和希瓦艾什先生的合約是你主持簽訂的，你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很難講呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們和喀蘭貿易的交易已經持續了幾個月，這筆大訂單本身沒有任何問題，他找到我們，希望購買鎮痛劑，我們答應了，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我們並不清楚他對於感染者的真實看法。而且從所謂的商業邏輯來說，他確實用錢從我們這裡購買了鎮痛劑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這一批鎮痛劑已經是他的了，怎麼處置是他的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"只是對我們來說，這並不是用商業行為做藉口就能蓋過去的事就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你對這件事有什麼看法嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"希瓦艾什......是誰？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"希瓦艾什，是個什麼樣的人？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"希瓦艾什，真是個獨特的姓氏......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！我都忘了，那個時候博士你還不在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧我，最近因為博士越來越可靠了，就下意識地感覺你什麼都知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"希瓦艾什先生全名恩希歐迪斯·希瓦艾什，是喀蘭貿易的總裁，也是我們的一大客戶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他好像一直希望為自己的感染者員工購買一定的人身保障，同時為自己感染了礦石病的妹妹，也就是崖心小姐尋求治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在聯絡了許多家醫藥公司後，最終找到了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，他在這件事上很堅定，但也很謹慎。經過了很長一段時間的協商後，最終與我們簽訂了一份大訂單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"他購買了一份囊括他所有員工的醫療保障協議，以及每家分公司都有的鎮痛劑份額。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"因為鎮痛劑只有在病發時能夠起到作用，所以交給每家分公司的鎮痛劑數量我們都做了分別統計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"以保證每個感染者員工每季度都能拿到一份鎮痛劑，而且公司還有儲備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"而這些都是他的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我是第一次見到有老闆為了自己公司的感染者出手這麼闊綽呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"至於這位總裁是什麼人這一點......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"約一年前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您要一次訂購......這麼多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。你們已經向我證明了你們的鎮痛劑確實有效，我希望能為我所有的感染者員工都購買一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相應的，我希望貴公司能夠提供一個折扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您的這筆訂單在以往所有公司與我們簽訂的訂單中都算是龐大的，原則上您希望有一個折扣也是理所當然的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我們羅德島生產藥物的原材料也十分昂貴，其實算下來，一份鎮痛劑的價格，和成本並沒有相差太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你做不了主的話，可以請貴公司的領導人阿米婭小姐來與我商議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這件事我可以決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我想說的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島生產的藥物是為了幫助感染者而存在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您能夠保證，這些藥能夠順利地送到那些感染礦石病的員工手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Medic......小姐，貴公司似乎都是以代號互相稱呼，我也入鄉隨俗吧。你接下來有空嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建立在這座城市的分公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁？！您怎麼來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安排一下，我要見一見感染礦石病的員工們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我就在現場和希瓦艾什先生一起把鎮痛劑分給在那裡工作的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，隨著我們合作的深入，他還將他的妹妹送來了羅德島治病，也就是幹員崖心小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來他不像那些一看就是不太情願地為自己的員工購買藥物的老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，說實話，親自為員工分發藥劑，哪怕只是作秀，這片大地上恐怕也沒有幾家公司的老闆願意做吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，你覺得這是這家分公司管理層的獨斷行為？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不敢肯定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有看透這個人，他給我的感覺就是那種完全猜不透在想什麼的類型......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我越覺得我應該相信他，就越會對自己敲響警鐘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們需要確認一下他的想法。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果直接拿著這件事去找他談判的話，我不認為他會直接承認。"}]},{"label":"我們需要小心行事。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，作為我們的大客戶，同時也是崖心的哥哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"稍有不慎，就會演變成大問題呢。"}]},{"label":"不能忽視崖心的感受。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，在沒有直接證據的情況下，武斷地和喀蘭斷絕關係，崖心的處境會很尷尬......我也不希望被她記恨呢。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，博士，我們應該怎麼做？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我有一個想法。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，上午的工作就到這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"休息時間一小時，所有人排好隊，按順序領飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）呼......按照博士的要求混了進來，接下來就是四處看看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"哥們，你是新來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"那你算是來對了，我們這家公司，對感染者待遇算不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我就是聽說這家公司對感染者不算差才想來試一試的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"所以照你這麼說，這家公司真的挺不錯的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我以前是在另一個廠房工作的，得病了之後被調到這個專門讓感染者員工工作的廠房來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"本來以為會跟聽說的那樣，大公司的感染者崗位都不是一般人能堅持下來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"結果比我想像的好了不少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"而且希瓦艾什總裁還從一家醫藥公司給我們買了對礦石病有效果的鎮痛劑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"經理說了，每個月業績最好的人可以得到一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的老闆上哪兒去找？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，過兩天希瓦艾什總裁要來這邊視察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個平時還算機靈，我打算讓你們作為代表見一見總裁，知道自己該怎麼做吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"當然當然，總裁願意給我們工作我們已經感恩戴德了，哪敢說些別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，光是現在這樣的工作在別的地方想都不敢想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這兩支鎮痛劑，賞你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝經理，謝謝經理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這些藥的去向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我們人人都收到了藥劑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就好，行了，都滾吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"您走好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這就滾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，真不是東西，自己把藥都私吞了，還逼我們配合他欺騙總裁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"能怎麼辦？你敢去向總裁檢舉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不敢，誰知道總裁走了會是個什麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"而且也不知道總裁是不是真的會向著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡會有向著感染者的公司老闆啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是這樣，剛才有句話倒是真的，在這裡的工作也已經是別的地方想都不敢想的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，雖然對不起其他兄弟，但也只能聽他的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。這藥，你打算怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我老婆在我得病後就跑了，丟下我和女兒兩個人，我得給自己留著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我就留著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"這藥好像只有在病發的時候有抑制疼痛的作用，本身對病情也沒什麼幫助。等其他人哪個病情發作了，我再給他用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒想到你這麼大方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"都是可憐人，真看別人痛不欲生你就過意得去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......自己的命都顧不上，哪還顧得上別人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"博士，你透過通訊器也都聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"唉，這種事，真是到哪裡都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"雖然在維多利亞，在員工因為工作不慎感染礦石病後，一些公司也會繼續提供崗位給感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"但是，這些崗位和要感染者給他們幹白工幾乎沒有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"一些貴族還整天把這些事情拿出來說，彷彿這就是維多利亞貴族的優雅一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"說白了，沒有多少公司真的願意為感染者花錢，也沒有多少人會因為虐待感染者真的受到處罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"不過，根據這些天我潛伏下來的結果來看，感覺這個恩希歐迪斯總裁倒確實挺厲害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"幾乎白手起家，短短幾年時間就把喀蘭貿易這家公司做到了在維多利亞有好幾家分公司的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"而且，對感染者好像也不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"和我們的訂單就不用說了，這家公司的感染者崗位待遇基本算是我見過的最好的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"也難怪這裡的感染者員工好像都挺佩服他的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這只能證明......他很懂管理學。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這和他會轉賣鎮痛劑並不矛盾。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"這倒......也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"我懂了，博士。也就是說，我們需要一些決定性的證據。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"鎮痛劑的去向。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"沒錯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞特先生，好久不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"萊頓先生！確實是有一段時間沒見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間過得可好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，托你的福，睡得香，吃得好，自在得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，不知道我要的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，鎮痛劑都在箱子裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！不愧是迪亞特先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這一批，數量比我想的要少一些啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間是淡季，沒有那麼多感染者來上工。不過我們公司嘛，你也知道，感染者之間很出名，勝在穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"懂的懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也不瞞你，和往常一樣，我留了一些。我也沒有那麼狠心，感染者也要生活的嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"說得是啊，嘖嘖，像您這樣真心願意為感染者著想的領導，時下可真是難找了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，相信我，萊頓先生，這是一種新的趨勢，一種名為文明的趨勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的那些野蠻人只知道把感染者抓起來殺了，這真是太落後了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"而即使是維多利亞的同行們，大多也只知道一味地壓榨感染者，這真是太不文明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者又不是動物，他們也聽得懂人話。適當地給他們一些獎勵，他們就會更加辛勤地工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這樣，既善待感染者，又有生意做，才是更加文明的方式嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"說得太對了！要好好感謝維多利亞這個文明的國家，還有我們善待感染者的恩希歐迪斯總裁才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"敬文明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"敬文明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，他......要不是現在不能暴露，我真想現在就衝上去把這兩個混帳狠狠揍一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這樣至少能夠確認，恩希歐迪斯總裁確實沒有參與其中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你們肯定想不到，你們虛偽至極的話已經完全被我錄下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"敬鎮痛劑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商業間諜","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"敬鎮痛劑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......呼......忍住，我要忍住，要把這一段全部錄下來才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"博士，這樣證據應該足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"雖然給你發了一份，不過建議你不要多聽，容易晚上睡不著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"放心。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"習慣了。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"一群人渣。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"那麼，接下來就是告訴恩希歐迪斯總裁這一切了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"博士，怎麼辦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不是說，過幾天，他會來這座城市視察。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你聽說沒有，昨天希瓦艾什總裁好像來到我們這座城市了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？我聽說他會來廠房這邊轉一轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我一直想見見開了這家公司的希瓦艾什總裁是個什麼樣的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"救命......我的礦石病病發了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，要是這人爆炸就完了，我可不想死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，做戲做全套，去大鬧一場吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁，這是上個季度的報表，您請過目。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，您如果要參觀公司的話，我特意找了幾個感染者員工的代表還有一般員工的代表來為您帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"比起我，還是他們給您說一些公司的東西更有說服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"排練了幾次？要特意給我看的東西真的已經準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞特，我並不在乎你對我隱瞞了多少，我只在乎，你拿出了多少成績。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，如果你打算欺騙別人，就不要輕易讓人看出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是在喀蘭貿易工作時感染的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我是，總裁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我是聽說這裡待遇好才來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們覺得喀蘭貿易如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得這裡的待遇真的挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我也這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閃開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊在吵什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你是新來沒多久的......你到這裡來幹什麼，沒看到總裁在這裡嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是恩希歐迪斯總裁嗎？救救我，我的身體出了問題，我需要藥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藥劑應該已經來到了你們的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啊，我什麼都沒收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"博士，你要我假裝礦石病病發，然後去找希瓦艾什總裁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那時候，他的身邊沒有我們的人。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"在沒有外人時，一個人的反應很難作假。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":true,"text":"原來如此，用這種方法來確認希瓦艾什總裁對感染者的真實看法嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用緊張，你會沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞特，拿藥來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"您不怕我嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是喀蘭貿易的員工，我為什麼要怕你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁竟然會這麼親切地對待感染者，我從沒見過這樣的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要加入喀蘭貿易，就都是我的員工，感染者與否，我並不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，應當分發給這位員工的鎮痛劑呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這......哈哈，對了，他是新入職的，還沒有輪到他呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謊言還不夠高明，迪亞特，每批次額外的配給就是為了應對這種情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁，迪亞特，他......根本沒有給員工分發鎮痛劑，我這裡，有證據......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"感染者員工掙扎著從服裝裡掏出一支筆一樣的裝置，隨著他輕輕一按，酒吧中，迪亞特與萊頓的對話清晰地被再現了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是什麼時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......迪亞特，你這混蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁，迪亞特總經理根本沒有向所有感染者員工發放鎮痛劑，不僅如此，他還欺騙所有人說鎮痛劑只給業績最好者發放！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"別衝動啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁對這個感染者這麼好，我今天也豁出去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅這樣，他還違背了員工手冊上的條例，壓縮我們的休息時間，讓我們不停地工作！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他怕做得太過火被您發現，所以一直控制在一個度上，但是他確實做了這些事，您隨便找一個這裡的人問問都知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"他說的沒錯，總裁！迪亞特總是把自己當成我們的救星，侮辱我們，逼迫我們服侍他，這個人就是個徹底的混蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"他還要把藥留著照顧女兒，這裡就用我的這份鎮痛劑吧，總裁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的好意，我就心領了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這位員工的礦石病病情還很危險，以防萬一，這裡交給我處理就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但這樣您不就危險了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了，我相信您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也相信您！今天發生的事，我這輩子都不會忘記的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，離這裡遠一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）這就是恩希歐迪斯·希瓦艾什......好厲害的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"總、總裁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，迪亞特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為管理者，你應當瞭解，該向你的下屬展現哪一面，又要將哪一面藏起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你要施恩還是威懾，都應當確保你的對象不會背叛你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像剛才那兩個人，很顯然，你的威懾僅僅流於表面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這......您不生氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼要生氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你無視了我定下的規則，但你拿出了你的成績，我又為何要生氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮痛劑的去向，我可以不在乎，你可以當作這是我對你的獎勵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......總裁，您騙了我們嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈哈，哈哈哈！不愧是總裁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！這些感染者早晚都是要死的，這些藥給他們又有什麼用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"而且身為貴族，教會感染者，誰才是真正的高貴者，有時候也是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道您也是為了在其他貴族面前樹立形象才去找那個什麼羅德島買藥簽合約！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這次是我錯了。如果您願意放我一馬，我願意將我轉賣這些藥劑賺的錢其中的一半交給您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，不會有任何人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一半？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......七成，不，八成！我、我也是要生活的，總裁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。比起這個，我更好奇，你一個人應該是做不成這些事的，讓我見一見你的協助者們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想知道一些能夠更好地處理羅德島的藥劑的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"您對這方面感興趣嗎？沒問題，這裡有幾個聯絡方式，您去找他們，說是我介紹的就好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他分公司的人有參與嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我在這項事業上的第一個合夥人，想一想其中的含義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，瞧我，糊塗了，您看我的這份備忘錄就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，您要是打算做些什麼，請千萬帶上我，嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就這麼正大光明地在我面前說這些，就不怕我們說出去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"說出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道以為你今天能夠活著走出這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一名員工的損失，對這家公司的體量來說，並不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不會讓你們稱心如意的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者能夠不借助施術單元使用法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的傳染具備不確定性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們死後，還可能引起二次傳染，危害周邊的環境和人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩希歐迪斯走到員工身邊，從他懷中掏出一個始終沒有停止通訊的終端，對著那一頭的人發問。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，為什麼你們會認為，你們值得被善待？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"適可而止吧。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"事實上我也認為，讓這場鬧劇在這裡停下是一個不壞的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我應當感謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而你，恐怕也應當感謝我，羅德島的博士。"}]},{"label":"並不是感染者期望如此。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這是一種過時的辯護論點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們並非在經歷一個過程，而是已經處在了一個千百年以來累積的結果中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"想撼動這樣的結果，何其困難？"}]},{"label":"這正是我們努力的目標。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"當你根本無法看見目標時，所謂的努力，只是自欺欺人的同義詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但我想，今天的我不會輕易地給出不切實際的評價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"因為你出現在了我的面前。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"總之，不知道這些情報，足夠向羅德島表現喀蘭貿易的誠意嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"足夠。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那再好不過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"總......裁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你提供的情報，迪亞特，你讓喀蘭貿易在羅德島挽回了聲譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"難道這個人......是羅德島的人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應當早一些發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，很遺憾，你被解雇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"您......難道只是在欺騙我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，為什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"難道您真的同情這些感染者嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並不是一個值得討論這個話題的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可......您不是認可我拿出的成績了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是說，你拿出了成績。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，難道你認為，你拿出了令我滿意的成績嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"激進的手段應當有激進手段的回報，而你憑藉這樣的手段卻僅僅取得了正常管理就能取得的結果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憑什麼認為你能令我滿意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"分公司經理","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"分公司經理迪亞特軟軟地癱坐在地上，像一攤爛泥一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"總裁，是總裁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了保障各位感染者員工的人身安全，我前往羅德島為各位購買了藥劑與保險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而公司管理上的疏忽，以及管理人員的失職，卻讓藥物沒有正確地送到各位手上，對此，我感到十分痛心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這不怪您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"錯的是迪亞特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，迪亞特已經被解雇，並且，新的經理將從各位之中挑選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望透過這種方式，你們能夠更好地進行工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？太棒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總裁萬歲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在此，我想特別感謝兩個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來自羅德島的兩位秘密檢察官......正是他們的勇敢行為，才讓我能夠發現迪亞特一直以來對我掩藏的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是那個新人嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"原來他們就是給我們製作藥品的公司的人嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"為了感染者，他們居然願意做到這個地步......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是羅德島的職責所在。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你們總是可以相信羅德島。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"感染者的生命同樣珍貴。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有諸多人對於購買藥物這件事不理解，而這種不理解，最終轉化成了對公司方針的陽奉陰違。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了杜絕這種情況，我決定與羅德島商談，由羅德島派出秘密隊伍，在喀蘭貿易的分公司中進行暗中監察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意在揪出像迪亞特這樣危害公司營運，同時又在損害羅德島形象的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而作為回報，羅德島願意加深與喀蘭貿易的合作，並且進一步下調藥物的價格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣對吧，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......正是如此。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者員工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？博士，還有這種事嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，羅德島願意為在工作的所有員工提供一次免費的現場體檢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"各位員工，請在這邊排隊，我們會為每個人都發放一份鎮痛劑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是什麼時候發現的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題過於缺乏意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是我反問你，你真的有打算騙過我嗎？羅德島的Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒有。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道在我看到那名“感染者”時就有可能露出馬腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是對你來說，在那時，你的目的已經達成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後無論怎樣發展，你都沒有輸，真是好算計。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"過獎。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也沒有十全把握。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島忽然空降了一位善於運籌帷幄、調兵遣將的領導人，這並不是一個秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我在見到你之前，確實沒想到，這樣的人物，竟然會親自來到我的公司，在我面前上演這樣一出鬧劇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看來你對羅德島的評價很高。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的妹妹在羅德島接受治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最得力的兩個部下也會向我傳達在羅德島的見聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何人在掀開你們神秘面紗的一角後，恐怕都不會小覷你們。"}]},{"label":"我這麼有名？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的妹妹與我最得力的兩個部下都不止一次提及你的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法不知道你的存在。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我想知道，Dr.{@nickname}，我給出的答覆，是否令你滿意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"滿意。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嘴上這樣說，眼神卻在直白地告訴我你並非這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的演技並不糟糕，那麼，你是想告訴我，這一次，就這樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對嗎？"}]},{"label":"不滿意。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不討厭直白的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你在剛才默許了我對你行為的小小報復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著我們的合作還將繼續，對嗎？"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這也令我有些疑惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這毫無疑問是一場演員、場景以及道具都有所欠缺的鬧劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不具備任何從觀眾角度來說令其感到心潮澎湃的要素。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對此心知肚明，甚至準備了十分殘酷的結尾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，如果我令你失望，會發生什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你會失去一個合作夥伴，僅此而已。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對一場鬧劇來說，一個充滿現實主義的結尾會顯得編劇過於小題大做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非，這場鬧劇的核心對於你這個編劇來說，足夠重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這個核心，是我對於感染者的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，這個問題對你來說，有多重要？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很重要。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們會慎重挑選每一個合作夥伴。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那位醫療幹員小姐要求我親手將藥劑交給員工們，我也依然沒有認為這是某種你們的信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我要稍微修正一些我的觀念......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我見過許多理想主義者，他們高談闊論著這片大地上的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在那之中，唯獨沒有感染者這個詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這意味著什麼嗎，Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著，你們如果不是瘋子，那麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你人呢，該出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我馬上會到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來這場談話要到此為止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還無法回答你的問題，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果你會下棋，我期待未來拜訪羅德島的時候，能夠與你切磋一番。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，一點小插曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來可不像只是經歷了一點小插曲的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，羅德島的新領袖，是個失憶了的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？怎麼忽然沒頭沒腦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人似乎在很短的時間裡就令羅德島上的諸多幹員折服，並且確立了明確的行動方針。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個失憶的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來是挺古怪的，但是，這和你有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_npc_257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]}]}
